nk:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(180 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(207.203125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_18\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(276.935381 15.4) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-8f\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(180 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(207.203125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_19\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(333.097719 15.4) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-43\" d=\"M 3411 2829 Q 3411 2330 3267 1894 Q 3123 1459 2883 1094 Q 2643 730 2364 451 Q 2086 173 1818 0 L 1126 0 Q 1606 352 1945 685 Q 2285 1018 2509 1408 Q 2733 1798 2854 2317 L 2822 2330 Q 2720 2150 2573 2003 Q 2426 1856 2224 1773 Q 2022 1690 1747 1690 Q 1363 1690 1065 1856 Q 768 2022 598 2332 Q 429 2643 429 3066 Q 429 3507 614 3840 Q 800 4173 1133 4358 Q 1466 4544 1914 4544 Q 2381 4544 2713 4336 Q 3046 4128 3228 3744 Q 3411 3360 3411 2829 z\nM 1920 2144 Q 2214 2144 2422 2253 Q 2630 2362 2742 2573 Q 2854 2784 2854 3085 L 2854 3136 Q 2854 3437 2742 3648 Q 2630 3859 2422 3968 Q 2214 4077 1920 4077 Q 1626 4077 1418 3968 Q 1210 3859 1098 3648 Q 986 3437 986 3136 L 986 3085 Q 986 2784 1098 2573 Q 1210 2362 1418 2253 Q 1626 2144 1920 2144 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\" d=\"M 3187 4467 L 3187 3994 L 1229 3994 L 1101 2291 L 1146 2291 Q 1254 2445 1376 2553 Q 1498 2662 1664 2723 Q 1830 2784 2061 2784 Q 2445 2784 2745 2617 Q 3046 2451 3219 2144 Q 3392 1837 3392 1402 Q 3392 966 3213 633 Q 3034 301 2698 112 Q 2362 -77 1888 -77 Q 1517 -77 1254 35 Q 992 147 809 320 Q 627 493 493 685 L 896 992 Q 1069 730 1277 566 Q 1485 403 1888 403 Q 2342 403 2582 646 Q 2822 890 2822 1331 L 2822 1395 Q 2822 1837 2582 2080 Q 2342 2323 1888 2323 Q 1581 2323 1405 2211 Q 1229 2099 1088 1946 L 634 2010 L 794 4467 L 3187 4467 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-43\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(180 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\" transform=\"translate(207.203125 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p90c46ee583\"><rect x=\"30.4\" y=\"10.472\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"149.688\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Where the fund's return comes from ($M)","note":null},"answer":"<p>Ten labs × $1M × 5 = $50M of extra debt. EBITDA in year 5: $12.2M + $10M = $22.2M. Exit value at 9×: $199M.</p> <p>Debt at exit: $40M + $50M − $20M = $70M. Equity: <b>$129M</b>. Return: <b>3.2×</b> (about 26% a year).</p> <p><b>So-what:</b> buying labs at 5× and selling them as part of a group at 9× is what makes the deal work.</p>","note":"Each add-on lab is bought for $5M but is worth $9M inside the group at exit."},{"q":"What if exit multiples don't rise and the group still sells at 8×?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<p>Exit value: $22.2M × 8 = $177M; equity $107M; return <b>2.7×</b>. Still above target.</p> <p>The bigger risk is execution: buying and integrating 10 labs in five years, and keeping their dentist customers.</p>"}],"reco":"Invest, with the buy-and-build plan as the core of the case. On its own, Crescent returns only about 2.2× in five years. Adding 10 small labs at 5× EBITDA lifts EBITDA to about $22M and the return to about 3.2× (26% a year), and still 2.7× if the exit multiple stays at 8×. Risks: integrating labs and keeping their dentists, and paying more for add-ons as rivals copy the strategy. Next step: build a pipeline of 20 target labs before signing.","great":["Computes entry equity, exit equity and the money multiple","Shows the business alone misses the target","Explains multiple arbitrage in buy-and-build","Stress-tests the exit multiple"],"id":67,"slug":"crescent-dental-labs"}